<title>UNITED NATIONS: Swedish envoy becomes Security Council president.</title>
<headline>Swedish envoy becomes Security Council president.</headline>
<dateline>UNITED NATIONS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish U.N. ambassador Peter Osvald took over the presidency of the Security Council on Tuesday, succeeding ambassador Sergei Lavrov of Russia.</p>
<p>The post rotates monthly according to the English alphabetical order of the council's 15 member delegations.</p>
</text>
